    {
      "flavor_text": "Its boulder-like\nbody is extremely\nhard. It can\feasily withstand\ndynamite blasts\nwithout damage.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "blue",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/2/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Once it sheds its\nskin, its body\nturns tender and\fwhitish. Its hide\nhardens when it's\nexposed to air.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "yellow",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It sheds its skin\nonce a year. The\ndiscarded shell\fimmediately hard­\nens and crumbles\naway.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "gold",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It is capable of\nblowing itself up.\nIt uses this\fexplosive force to\njump from mountain\nto mountain.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "silver",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its rock-like body\nis so durable,\neven high-powered\fdynamite blasts\nfail to scratch\nits rugged hide.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "crystal",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "GOLEM live up on mountains.\nIf there is a large earthquake, these\nPOKéMON will come rolling down off\fthe mountains en masse to the\nfoothills below.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ruby",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "GOLEM is known for rolling down from\nmountains. To prevent them from rolling\ninto the homes of people downhill,\fgrooves have been dug into the sides of\nmountains to serve as guideways for\ndiverting this POKéMON’s course.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sapphire",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It is said to live in volcanic craters\non mountain peaks. Once a year, it sheds\nits hide and grows larger. The shed hide\ncrumbles and returns to the soil.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "emerald",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It is enclosed in a hard shell that is as\nrugged as slabs of rock. It sheds skin\nonce a year to grow larger.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "firered",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/10/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its boulder-like body is extremely hard.\nIt can easily withstand dynamite blasts\nwithout taking damage.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "leafgreen",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It sheds its hide once a year.\nIts boulderlike body is so tough,\neven dynamite can’t harm it.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "diamond",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/12/"
      }
    },
    {
