        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "だっぴ　したてのときは　ぜんたいが\nしろっぽく　やわらかいが　すぐに\nくうきに　ふれて　かたくなる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/31/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "탈피한 직후에는 전체가\n하얗고 부드럽지만 금방\n공기와 접촉해서 단단해진다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/31/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "剛蛻皮的時候身體比較軟\n而且顏色偏白，但在接觸到\n空氣後很快就會變硬。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/31/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Juste après la mue, son corps est blanc et\ntendre. Au contact de l’air, sa peau se solidifie\net forme une armure.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/31/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nachdem es sich gehäutet hat, wird sein Körper\nweich und hell. Durch den Kontakt mit der Luft\nerhärtet er aber sofort wieder.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/31/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nada más mudar la piel, su cuerpo se vuelve\nblando y blanquecino, pero se endurece al poco\ntiempo de entrar en contacto con el aire.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/31/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Subito dopo la muta il suo corpo è bianco\ne morbido, ma al contatto con l’aria si trasforma\nimmediatamente in una dura corazza.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/31/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Once it sheds its skin, its body turns tender\nand whitish. Its hide hardens when it’s\nexposed to air.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/31/"
      }
    },
